(644664, 67267, 15032, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, personally, I would have like to see a white and black pawn switched</td>', 'I like the idea, personally, I would have like to see a white and black pawn switched', '2004-03-31 01:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(644667, 66998, 15032, '<td valign="top">Great Idea, nice exposure.</td>', 'Great Idea, nice exposure.', '2004-03-31 01:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(644668, 67584, 15032, '<td valign="top">I like it, but I think the extreme blue tint is somewhat distracting</td>', 'I like it, but I think the extreme blue tint is somewhat distracting', '2004-03-31 01:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(644670, 67507, 13669, '<td valign="top">Oh man I love this one!</td>', 'Oh man I love this one!', '2004-03-31 01:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(644672, 67285, 6999, '<td valign="top">Real crispness of detail is missing from this shot - though I couldn''t say whether that''s from processing or camera. It makes it difficult for it to have any great impact, like having to look at it through half-closed eyes.</td>', 'Real crispness of detail is missing from this shot - though I couldn''t say whether that''s from processing or camera. It makes it difficult for it to have any great impact, like having to look at it through half-closed eyes.', '2004-03-31 01:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(644680, 66463, 17550, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, but not sure how it fits the theme...</td>', 'Very nice shot, but not sure how it fits the theme...', '2004-03-31 01:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(644684, 66786, 13669, '<td valign="top">HAHAHAHAAH....... funny</td>', 'HAHAHAHAAH....... funny', '2004-03-31 01:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(644686, 67322, 63, '<td valign="top">Wow, I have almost the same photo entered. Not many people know about the steel ones.  We must think alike, at least in this challenge.</td>', 'Wow, I have almost the same photo entered. Not many people know about the steel ones.  We must think alike, at least in this challenge.', '2004-03-31 01:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(644689, 67374, 13390, '<td valign="top">I like your humor! Ver different indeed!</td>', 'I like your humor! Ver different indeed!', '2004-03-31 01:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(644701, 67535, 6999, '<td valign="top">Your spot-editing leaves an awful lot to be desired  - especially as it is without the scope of the rules for this challenge. Anyways, it''s hardly convincing - it just obviously looks like two bits of photograph cobbled together along that left side of the ''puzzle''. I do quite like the mundanity of the location however, in this context.</td>', 'Your spot-editing leaves an awful lot to be desired  - especially as it is without the scope of the rules for this challenge. Anyways, it''s hardly convincing - it just obviously looks like two bits of photograph cobbled together along that left side of the ''puzzle''. I do quite like the mundanity of the location however, in this context.', '2004-03-31 01:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(644702, 67519, 13390, '<td valign="top">YES!!!!</td>', 'YES!!!!', '2004-03-31 01:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(644706, 67492, 13390, '<td valign="top">I hate it when tht happens!</td>', 'I hate it when tht happens!', '2004-03-31 01:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(644709, 67366, 6999, '<td valign="top">There is a certain appeal, despite what seems to me rather blatant lighting: the glare on the grape would perhaps have been something to avoid - makes it rather trying to look at. Nice idea though, and otherwise fine execution ... it''s just that lighting is so crucial to photography ... it cries out for the use of a soft-box, or at least a much more diffuse light-source that that you have used.</td>', 'There is a certain appeal, despite what seems to me rather blatant lighting: the glare on the grape would perhaps have been something to avoid - makes it rather trying to look at. Nice idea though, and otherwise fine execution ... it''s just that lighting is so crucial to photography ... it cries out for the use of a soft-box, or at least a much more diffuse light-source that that you have used.', '2004-03-31 01:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(644715, 67493, 16477, '<td valign="top">boys is he in trouble, cute</td>', 'boys is he in trouble, cute', '2004-03-31 01:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(644717, 67339, 6999, '<td valign="top">Uninteresting - and, I fear, not even a terribly good cat shot. There''s motion blur, presumably from a hurried hand-held shot, and it''s way over-exposed, so that all sense of colour has leached out of it. It may hold emotional resonance for you, but I''m afraid for me it is of no interest at all.</td>', 'Uninteresting - and, I fear, not even a terribly good cat shot. There''s motion blur, presumably from a hurried hand-held shot, and it''s way over-exposed, so that all sense of colour has leached out of it. It may hold emotional resonance for you, but I''m afraid for me it is of no interest at all.', '2004-03-31 01:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(644718, 67285, 16477, '<td valign="top">i hope you do well, very well shot , just feel too tightly cropped, still  very nice,, 9 from side</td>', 'i hope you do well, very well shot , just feel too tightly cropped, still  very nice,, 9 from side', '2004-03-31 01:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
