(644730, 67293, 13390, '<td valign="top">VERY COOL!!! I am just going to take a stab at how you did this (I could be wrong), but did you happen to pull the cue ball back to get the blurring effect without having to ruin your pool table. Very cool though!</td>', 'VERY COOL!!! I am just going to take a stab at how you did this (I could be wrong), but did you happen to pull the cue ball back to get the blurring effect without having to ruin your pool table. Very cool though!', '2004-03-31 01:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
