(644735, 67533, 13390, '<td valign="top">My dad uses the Polo and I use the Nautica! How ironic! I hate it when womens tuff get''s misplaced in my junk too! Nice lighting and composition!</td>', 'My dad uses the Polo and I use the Nautica! How ironic! I hate it when womens tuff get''s misplaced in my junk too! Nice lighting and composition!', '2004-03-31 01:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
