(644872, 67507, 9809, '<td valign="top">While I''m not one to be a sucker for baby shots, I am a sucker for a well composed photo. The angle of the shot with the head seemingly oversized due to the aperture used and closeness of the lens-- whatever -- plus the straight on look of the "package contents" make this one of the best photos in the challenge, so far. Excellent DOF and well framed. Good luck. I don''t give out many 10''s but this is one.</td>', 'While I''m not one to be a sucker for baby shots, I am a sucker for a well composed photo. The angle of the shot with the head seemingly oversized due to the aperture used and closeness of the lens-- whatever -- plus the straight on look of the "package contents" make this one of the best photos in the challenge, so far. Excellent DOF and well framed. Good luck. I don''t give out many 10''s but this is one.', '2004-03-31 02:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
