(645217, 67044, 15919, '<td valign="top">Comic but litle caotic to.  Use fewer chesmen and make the more widespred.  Also think that another angel and swallover DOF to blurr out some parts of the image would have given a better results.  More contrast and/or colorsaturation wouldnt have hurt it either.</td>', 'Comic but litle caotic to.  Use fewer chesmen and make the more widespred.  Also think that another angel and swallover DOF to blurr out some parts of the image would have given a better results.  More contrast and/or colorsaturation wouldnt have hurt it either.', '2004-03-31 09:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
