(645291, 67524, 5391, '<td valign="top">This could be better in several ways - there are spots of bad overexposure; it would help if the stuffed toys were arranged in a way that they looked like they were carefully places, not so that you see their backs and most of them are unrecognizable; and perhaps if the cactus wasn''t dead center, if the rule of thirds or some such was used in the composition.  The idea for the challenge is great, the execution is poor.</td>', 'This could be better in several ways - there are spots of bad overexposure; it would help if the stuffed toys were arranged in a way that they looked like they were carefully places, not so that you see their backs and most of them are unrecognizable; and perhaps if the cactus wasn''t dead center, if the rule of thirds or some such was used in the composition.  The idea for the challenge is great, the execution is poor.', '2004-03-31 10:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
