(645379, 67292, 6008, '<td valign="top">The idea is cute and certainly fits the challenge, but it has a ''snapshot'' feel to it. A single color background, such as a sheet over the chair, would have cleared some of the distraction from the background and isolated the foreground elements more. The bear on the right is cropped out of the frame and ideally would be better completely in the frame. The lighting could also have been slightly brighter, which may have helped with the softness of the image also.</td>', 'The idea is cute and certainly fits the challenge, but it has a ''snapshot'' feel to it. A single color background, such as a sheet over the chair, would have cleared some of the distraction from the background and isolated the foreground elements more. The bear on the right is cropped out of the frame and ideally would be better completely in the frame. The lighting could also have been slightly brighter, which may have helped with the softness of the image also.', '2004-03-31 10:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
