(645403, 67391, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good idea and meets the challenge. The white beans have good color to them and stand out well from the background, with just the highlights a little blown. Because of the dof used the black bean (or is it blue?) looks somewhat like a dark blob. I''m assuming you were going for the ostracized look, which does work, but I think having the black/blue bean be more in focus and more defined would be better, even possibly moving it to the lower right hand corner.</td>', 'Good idea and meets the challenge. The white beans have good color to them and stand out well from the background, with just the highlights a little blown. Because of the dof used the black bean (or is it blue?) looks somewhat like a dark blob. I''m assuming you were going for the ostracized look, which does work, but I think having the black/blue bean be more in focus and more defined would be better, even possibly moving it to the lower right hand corner.', '2004-03-31 10:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
