(645825, 67118, 16965, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo!</td>', 'Interesting photo!', '2004-03-31 14:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(645829, 67195, 18484, '<td valign="top">well done!</td>', 'well done!', '2004-03-31 14:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(645831, 66595, 18484, '<td valign="top">great lighting.</td>', 'great lighting.', '2004-03-31 14:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(645835, 67519, 6008, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness, those poor things. Whereas this does meet the challenge, I have to wonder how many shots it took and how long they were in there. The potential for disaster looks very large. Hrm, can I give an unbiased opinion of this. What I see mostly is shock, very eeepy, that said I dont care for the cropped out base of the blender - should have tried to get it all in or cropped it higher.</td>', 'Oh my goodness, those poor things. Whereas this does meet the challenge, I have to wonder how many shots it took and how long they were in there. The potential for disaster looks very large. Hrm, can I give an unbiased opinion of this. What I see mostly is shock, very eeepy, that said I dont care for the cropped out base of the blender - should have tried to get it all in or cropped it higher.', '2004-03-31 14:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(645836, 67224, 16965, '<td valign="top">Wild image.  I''m not sure how many people will understand it, though.</td>', 'Wild image.  I''m not sure how many people will understand it, though.', '2004-03-31 14:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(645837, 67359, 18484, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been a visually stronger picture without the detergent.</td>', 'I think it would have been a visually stronger picture without the detergent.', '2004-03-31 14:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(645839, 67424, 6008, '<td valign="top">Composition is fine, meets the challenge and goes with the popular saying. I dont really see anything ''wrong'' but it doesnt have much appeal or interest to me in the long run. Just an average photo for me, sorry.</td>', 'Composition is fine, meets the challenge and goes with the popular saying. I dont really see anything ''wrong'' but it doesnt have much appeal or interest to me in the long run. Just an average photo for me, sorry.', '2004-03-31 14:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(645840, 66533, 18484, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2004-03-31 14:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(645844, 67164, 15129, '<td valign="top">Stunning!!!! Congratulations, and good luck.</td>', 'Stunning!!!! Congratulations, and good luck.', '2004-03-31 14:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(645845, 67572, 6008, '<td valign="top">First thing I think of is ''wow that''s a small phone or a large baby bottle''. It''s an interesting idea and fun take on the challenge. Technically it''s not so good. There are light flares on the bottle - open challenge so no editing so that makes it a tad more difficult. You''ve cropped a little too much off the bottom and it''s a tad unbalanced compared to the top - ideally you want to leave a little space all around a subject. I''m not sure what the black thing is, I assume a battery power or something, but it distracts from the phone and I dont think it really adds anything to the shot. Because the bottle is laying down on the background the background has become part of the shot, whereas ideally you want to isolate the foreground in shots like these. I assume there was a reason why you didnt stand the bottle up.</td>', 'First thing I think of is ''wow that''s a small phone or a large baby bottle''. It''s an interesting idea and fun take on the challenge. Technically it''s not so good. There are light flares on the bottle - open challenge so no editing so that makes it a tad more difficult. You''ve cropped a little too much off the bottom and it''s a tad unbalanced compared to the top - ideally you want to leave a little space all around a subject. I''m not sure what the black thing is, I assume a battery power or something, but it distracts from the phone and I dont think it really adds anything to the shot. Because the bottle is laying down on the background the background has become part of the shot, whereas ideally you want to isolate the foreground in shots like these. I assume there was a reason why you didnt stand the bottle up.', '2004-03-31 14:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(645847, 66903, 17065, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the colors, and all the other baloons. Nice composition. Are those parachuters in the background trying to escape the bunny?</td>', 'Good capture of the colors, and all the other baloons. Nice composition. Are those parachuters in the background trying to escape the bunny?', '2004-03-31 14:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(645848, 67401, 18484, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2004-03-31 14:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(645850, 67404, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like this, the toning, the composition, and overall presentation, but I''m just not seeing the out of place part. I''ll look at it again on my other monitor to see if I''m missing something but cant see what.</td>', 'I like this, the toning, the composition, and overall presentation, but I''m just not seeing the out of place part. I''ll look at it again on my other monitor to see if I''m missing something but cant see what.', '2004-03-31 14:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(645851, 67413, 18484, '<td valign="top">very funny. lol</td>', 'very funny. lol', '2004-03-31 14:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(645853, 67520, 17065, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, and nice shot. Out of the water ok, but out of place? Still a good shot though!</td>', 'Nice composition, and nice shot. Out of the water ok, but out of place? Still a good shot though!', '2004-03-31 14:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(645855, 67387, 15922, '<td valign="top">A beautiful photo, but unless I''m missing something I don''t really see how it fits this challenge</td>', 'A beautiful photo, but unless I''m missing something I don''t really see how it fits this challenge', '2004-03-31 14:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(645856, 67430, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good composition, although a shame about the top mast. I like the colorations on the boat, a nice muted color that contrasts with the blue sky and the white snow. Exposure is good and I see how it meets the challenge.</td>', 'Good composition, although a shame about the top mast. I like the colorations on the boat, a nice muted color that contrasts with the blue sky and the white snow. Exposure is good and I see how it meets the challenge.', '2004-03-31 14:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(645860, 66708, 18484, '<td valign="top">well done!</td>', 'well done!', '2004-03-31 14:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(645861, 67427, 17065, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and a good color match!</td>', 'Nice idea, and a good color match!', '2004-03-31 14:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(645862, 67353, 7889, '<td valign="top">Great humour, good take on challenge</td>', 'Great humour, good take on challenge', '2004-03-31 14:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(645863, 67267, 15922, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! For me this is by far the best of the chess photos that have appeared in the challenge, mainly because the soldier just helps create the feeling of a battle grounds. Even though he''s the one out of place, he makes you think the other pieces are all ready to fight as well :-)   Well done!</td>', 'Brilliant! For me this is by far the best of the chess photos that have appeared in the challenge, mainly because the soldier just helps create the feeling of a battle grounds. Even though he''s the one out of place, he makes you think the other pieces are all ready to fight as well :-)   Well done!', '2004-03-31 14:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(645864, 67357, 18484, '<td valign="top">great shot!</td>', 'great shot!', '2004-03-31 14:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(645865, 66652, 17065, '<td valign="top">Nice. I also like the fact that you stated other properties than the obvious ones in the title.</td>', 'Nice. I also like the fact that you stated other properties than the obvious ones in the title.', '2004-03-31 14:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(645866, 67315, 18191, '<td valign="top">good ol'' deagan...</td>', 'good ol'' deagan...', '2004-03-31 14:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(645869, 67496, 16106, '<td valign="top">Great subject but a bit too dark. I know that its hard to get good exposure on snow of a dark object without spot editing, but a slight increase in levels, while lowering the contrast might have really helped. Never the less this is a great capture with good focus and DOF.</td>', 'Great subject but a bit too dark. I know that its hard to get good exposure on snow of a dark object without spot editing, but a slight increase in levels, while lowering the contrast might have really helped. Never the less this is a great capture with good focus and DOF.', '2004-03-31 14:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(645870, 66463, 16106, '<td valign="top">Shame about those shadows, the forms are great, nice composition and framing.</td>', 'Shame about those shadows, the forms are great, nice composition and framing.', '2004-03-31 14:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(645871, 67450, 17065, '<td valign="top">Out of place allright!!  I think I would have tilted the photo a bit to get a horizontal horizon, and the skies seem a bit overexposed. Nice anyway</td>', 'Out of place allright!!  I think I would have tilted the photo a bit to get a horizontal horizon, and the skies seem a bit overexposed. Nice anyway', '2004-03-31 14:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(645876, 67362, 17065, '<td valign="top">The snow is a bit overexposed, but it''s a tricky shot with the white snow and shadows.</td>', 'The snow is a bit overexposed, but it''s a tricky shot with the white snow and shadows.', '2004-03-31 14:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(645877, 66595, 16106, '<td valign="top">Great colors, just beautifully balanced shot. How out of place a big fish is in a small pot I don''t know, but it makes a lovely photograph</td>', 'Great colors, just beautifully balanced shot. How out of place a big fish is in a small pot I don''t know, but it makes a lovely photograph', '2004-03-31 14:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(645879, 66973, 16106, '<td valign="top">great title, made me laugh. I wish you had gotten the roll into that patch of light. How dangerous was this shot?</td>', 'great title, made me laugh. I wish you had gotten the roll into that patch of light. How dangerous was this shot?', '2004-03-31 14:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(645880, 66673, 17065, '<td valign="top">I will put a 5 on this one. It is a really good picture, but to me there is nothing obviously out of place here. Really like the colours and composition though.</td>', 'I will put a 5 on this one. It is a really good picture, but to me there is nothing obviously out of place here. Really like the colours and composition though.', '2004-03-31 14:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(645883, 67194, 18731, '<td valign="top">i like this picture and the idea!</td>', 'i like this picture and the idea!', '2004-03-31 14:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(645884, 67267, 19281, '<td valign="top">:-)<br/>funny<br/>very original</td>', ':-)funnyvery original', '2004-03-31 14:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(645885, 67347, 16106, '<td valign="top">looks like the chaos challenge to me. Positives are the nice lighting and  color saturation, the negatives are the prominent items in the fore ground are out of focus and since everything is out of place, then no one thing looks out of place, the comosition lack that "Hamster in a blender" shock.</td>', 'looks like the chaos challenge to me. Positives are the nice lighting and  color saturation, the negatives are the prominent items in the fore ground are out of focus and since everything is out of place, then no one thing looks out of place, the comosition lack that "Hamster in a blender" shock.', '2004-03-31 14:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(645887, 67584, 17065, '<td valign="top">Typed on your keyboard:<br/>I likY OFis oCY!!!</td>', 'Typed on your keyboard:I likY OFis oCY!!!', '2004-03-31 14:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(645888, 66533, 7889, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and it looks good in b&amp;w, a little larger image would improve this, well done and good luck</td>', 'Nice idea and it looks good in b&w, a little larger image would improve this, well done and good luck', '2004-03-31 14:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(645890, 66958, 19281, '<td valign="top">nice works! i''d like to see the whole picture too :)</td>', 'nice works! i''d like to see the whole picture too :)', '2004-03-31 14:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(645892, 67430, 16106, '<td valign="top">Good subject, nice shot, my only knock is that the light seems a bit flat, could you have raised the contrast or the saturation of colors to give it more pop? Also since the contrast is between the boat and the snow, you have too much boat and not quite enough snow in the frame. I dont want to be critical, this is a nice shot, but it could be better.</td>', 'Good subject, nice shot, my only knock is that the light seems a bit flat, could you have raised the contrast or the saturation of colors to give it more pop? Also since the contrast is between the boat and the snow, you have too much boat and not quite enough snow in the frame. I dont want to be critical, this is a nice shot, but it could be better.', '2004-03-31 14:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(645894, 66894, 16595, '<td valign="top">its not focused</td>', 'its not focused', '2004-03-31 14:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(645895, 67230, 16106, '<td valign="top">Not terribly out of place but great shot! The blue of the pool edge really set up the duck''s colors.</td>', 'Not terribly out of place but great shot! The blue of the pool edge really set up the duck''s colors.', '2004-03-31 14:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(645897, 67532, 16106, '<td valign="top">Fine idea but a weird crop. Why so close cutting the edges off everything in the frame? step back and let me see the shapes.</td>', 'Fine idea but a weird crop. Why so close cutting the edges off everything in the frame? step back and let me see the shapes.', '2004-03-31 14:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(645901, 67487, 17065, '<td valign="top">Crop a bit more from the top, I think. Lovely shot, and well spotted.</td>', 'Crop a bit more from the top, I think. Lovely shot, and well spotted.', '2004-03-31 14:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(645903, 66941, 17065, '<td valign="top">Well, that''s what happens when you have green money... ;-)<br/>Nice macro shot</td>', 'Well, that''s what happens when you have green money... ;-)Nice macro shot', '2004-03-31 14:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(645904, 67198, 16106, '<td valign="top">Great expressions on the dogs! I would have liked to see nothing but that, the backround does nothing but distract. Why desaturate the colors? I would have thought given the title you chose that  the subjuect matter would have looked great in rich over the top color. Good shot, a tighter crop would have helped though.</td>', 'Great expressions on the dogs! I would have liked to see nothing but that, the backround does nothing but distract. Why desaturate the colors? I would have thought given the title you chose that  the subjuect matter would have looked great in rich over the top color. Good shot, a tighter crop would have helped though.', '2004-03-31 14:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(645905, 66769, 17065, '<td valign="top">Neat idea! Looks like people are running from the falling fish.</td>', 'Neat idea! Looks like people are running from the falling fish.', '2004-03-31 14:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(645906, 67078, 12151, '<td valign="top">dogs playing cars! haha. nice.</td>', 'dogs playing cars! haha. nice.', '2004-03-31 14:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(645912, 67362, 16106, '<td valign="top">Tough shot shooting across about four stops, and this is so blown out that I can only assume that the lake is frozen, but I can''t see it. If only you could use advanced editing, sigh.</td>', 'Tough shot shooting across about four stops, and this is so blown out that I can only assume that the lake is frozen, but I can''t see it. If only you could use advanced editing, sigh.', '2004-03-31 14:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(645915, 67523, 17065, '<td valign="top">A bit dull, but a lovely picture!</td>', 'A bit dull, but a lovely picture!', '2004-03-31 14:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(645917, 67348, 16106, '<td valign="top">Good composition but the backround dosen''t help. If you shot it on a peice of paper this would be a point or two higher.</td>', 'Good composition but the backround dosen''t help. If you shot it on a peice of paper this would be a point or two higher.', '2004-03-31 14:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(645922, 66842, 17065, '<td valign="top">well spotted!</td>', 'well spotted!', '2004-03-31 14:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(645923, 67484, 16106, '<td valign="top">Beautifull shot but I don''t see the challenge here.Pause , study......the prismatic light from a lightbulb? is that it? Sorry, I dont get it, and given the quality of the set up I am assuming that there is something to get, but I''m missing it.</td>', 'Beautifull shot but I don''t see the challenge here.Pause , study......the prismatic light from a lightbulb? is that it? Sorry, I dont get it, and given the quality of the set up I am assuming that there is something to get, but I''m missing it.', '2004-03-31 14:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
