(646274, 67578, 18868, '<td valign="top">technically nice -- good background, even lighting (although the can-opener seems a little flat), but something is missing.</td>', 'technically nice -- good background, even lighting (although the can-opener seems a little flat), but something is missing.', '2004-03-31 18:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
