(646387, 67523, 5120, '<td valign="top">I think the photo definitely fits the challenge but there is a bit much going on in the background for me.  I know that you need to have some DOF so you can see that it is in the woods, but maybe a little less DOF would have helped this one.  I also might have boosted up the saturation and had a little less contrast in this shot.  Something looks a bit too harsh for me but I am not exactly sure why.  It might also help if it was easier to tell that this was a plow, I pretty much have to take your word for it.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'I think the photo definitely fits the challenge but there is a bit much going on in the background for me.  I know that you need to have some DOF so you can see that it is in the woods, but maybe a little less DOF would have helped this one.  I also might have boosted up the saturation and had a little less contrast in this shot.  Something looks a bit too harsh for me but I am not exactly sure why.  It might also help if it was easier to tell that this was a plow, I pretty much have to take your word for it. Greg', '2004-03-31 19:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
