(646412, 67381, 5120, '<td valign="top">Very good idea here and fits the challenge very well.  There is something about this picture that makes me not like it as much as I could.  I think it is good that you have a wide filed of view so you can really see that this staircase is in the middle of a filed and indeed going nowhere but I think all the grass in the foreground is a little distracting.  Maybe if this had been taken in the late evening or early morning it would have been better.  I think it is the lighting that is hurting it for me.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'Very good idea here and fits the challenge very well.  There is something about this picture that makes me not like it as much as I could.  I think it is good that you have a wide filed of view so you can really see that this staircase is in the middle of a filed and indeed going nowhere but I think all the grass in the foreground is a little distracting.  Maybe if this had been taken in the late evening or early morning it would have been better.  I think it is the lighting that is hurting it for me. Greg', '2004-03-31 19:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
