(646477, 67348, 15919, '<td valign="top">Give it a more croping from the bottom to exclude the shelfedge.  More contrast and USM wouldnt have hurt.</td>', 'Give it a more croping from the bottom to exclude the shelfedge.  More contrast and USM wouldnt have hurt.', '2004-03-31 20:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
