(646553, 67448, 18868, '<td valign="top">Hey, I have the same calendar.  It''s also a couple of months behind.  Fun shot and obviously a lot of work to put together.  Would benefit from better lighting.</td>', 'Hey, I have the same calendar.  It''s also a couple of months behind.  Fun shot and obviously a lot of work to put together.  Would benefit from better lighting.', '2004-03-31 21:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
