(646568, 67224, 18868, '<td valign="top">Nice compositon, but it looks like a very tight crop -- the sky is very pixelated and the trees are very soft.n  And, I''m not really sure what'' s out of place.</td>', 'Nice compositon, but it looks like a very tight crop -- the sky is very pixelated and the trees are very soft.n  And, I''m not really sure what'' s out of place.', '2004-03-31 21:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
