(646626, 67362, 14863, '<td valign="top">Very bright- a little too blue but good capture</td>', 'Very bright- a little too blue but good capture', '2004-03-31 21:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(646627, 67272, 17802, '<td valign="top">Clean enough to eat off of :)</td>', 'Clean enough to eat off of :)', '2004-03-31 21:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(646628, 67475, 14863, '<td valign="top">Ah! Adorable- the writing on the toothpaste tube is a little distracting but the little mouse is precious- great job :D 9</td>', 'Ah! Adorable- the writing on the toothpaste tube is a little distracting but the little mouse is precious- great job :D 9', '2004-03-31 21:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(646635, 66919, 17724, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, not sure that the silos are out of place, though.  Assuming those are in fact houses in the picture, the silos would seem odd and out of place, but the angle of the shot makes it difficult to tell if they are houses or are just part of a farming complex.</td>', 'Nice picture, not sure that the silos are out of place, though.  Assuming those are in fact houses in the picture, the silos would seem odd and out of place, but the angle of the shot makes it difficult to tell if they are houses or are just part of a farming complex.', '2004-03-31 21:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(646637, 66990, 17724, '<td valign="top">Nice, quality photo.  Tell me you didn''t engage in insect cruelty to get this shot!</td>', 'Nice, quality photo.  Tell me you didn''t engage in insect cruelty to get this shot!', '2004-03-31 21:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(646638, 67479, 11832, '<td valign="top">HAHAHHAHA l love it, 10!</td>', 'HAHAHHAHA l love it, 10!', '2004-03-31 21:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(646640, 67384, 17724, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit in place to me.</td>', 'Seems a bit in place to me.', '2004-03-31 21:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(646641, 67435, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice... I''d like to see a very slightly higher viewpoint so the flower is surrounded by more black/ dark brown.</td>', 'Very nice... I''d like to see a very slightly higher viewpoint so the flower is surrounded by more black/ dark brown.', '2004-03-31 21:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(646643, 67562, 17724, '<td valign="top">Good use of focus on the middle-distant subject and certainly meets the challenge, but I have seen an awful lot of pencil/crayon pictures lately.</td>', 'Good use of focus on the middle-distant subject and certainly meets the challenge, but I have seen an awful lot of pencil/crayon pictures lately.', '2004-03-31 21:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(646645, 67357, 17724, '<td valign="top">Good job locating a real-life shot that meets the challenge.</td>', 'Good job locating a real-life shot that meets the challenge.', '2004-03-31 21:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(646650, 67173, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture, really horrible border. I just have to take off a point for it, as I can''t concentrate on the picture with it there.</td>', 'Wonderful picture, really horrible border. I just have to take off a point for it, as I can''t concentrate on the picture with it there.', '2004-03-31 21:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(646654, 67093, 17724, '<td valign="top">Good fit to the challenge, good capture of the flames, crisp focus - great job - 8.</td>', 'Good fit to the challenge, good capture of the flames, crisp focus - great job - 8.', '2004-03-31 21:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(646657, 67387, 17505, '<td valign="top">That fog looks about as ''in place'' as you can get...ignoring the challenge topic, it''s a nice photo.</td>', 'That fog looks about as ''in place'' as you can get...ignoring the challenge topic, it''s a nice photo.', '2004-03-31 22:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(646659, 67360, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not really sure what to make of this one... not being American, I had to read everything to work out what was being represented. So, I presume we have here a split between church and state. This does indeed look like separation, but not like out of place. What is out of place here?<br/>Very sharp photo though...</td>', 'Not really sure what to make of this one... not being American, I had to read everything to work out what was being represented. So, I presume we have here a split between church and state. This does indeed look like separation, but not like out of place. What is out of place here?Very sharp photo though...', '2004-03-31 22:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(646660, 67360, 17724, '<td valign="top">This seems to be more directed to contrast, or conflicting ideals, than "out of place"</td>', 'This seems to be more directed to contrast, or conflicting ideals, than "out of place"', '2004-03-31 22:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(646661, 67410, 18887, '<td valign="top">Definately out of place but sadly becomming commonplace...</td>', 'Definately out of place but sadly becomming commonplace...', '2004-03-31 22:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(646662, 67407, 17505, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea behind this photo, but it seems a little flat. It''s not in sharp focus, and I would like to see what happens if you had cropped it (or taken it) in portrait instead of landscape.</td>', 'I really like the idea behind this photo, but it seems a little flat. It''s not in sharp focus, and I would like to see what happens if you had cropped it (or taken it) in portrait instead of landscape.', '2004-03-31 22:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(646663, 67571, 17724, '<td valign="top">All of them seem out of place on the bedsheet, which is not a great backdrop here.  Picture is a bit dark.</td>', 'All of them seem out of place on the bedsheet, which is not a great backdrop here.  Picture is a bit dark.', '2004-03-31 22:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(646665, 66788, 17724, '<td valign="top">Good clarity and texture in this photo and meets the challenge - 7</td>', 'Good clarity and texture in this photo and meets the challenge - 7', '2004-03-31 22:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(646666, 66938, 18191, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites and the only thing that degrades teh photo is the mic going vertically through.</td>', 'One of my favorites and the only thing that degrades teh photo is the mic going vertically through.', '2004-03-31 22:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(646668, 67276, 18191, '<td valign="top">Probably my favorite of the chess photos. Next time you are doing this type of up close shot, try dusting off the board first.</td>', 'Probably my favorite of the chess photos. Next time you are doing this type of up close shot, try dusting off the board first.', '2004-03-31 22:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(646670, 67388, 18191, '<td valign="top">Freaky, man, but vert effective and very funny!</td>', 'Freaky, man, but vert effective and very funny!', '2004-03-31 22:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(646671, 67413, 17724, '<td valign="top">Definitely an original idea - does that thing take film?</td>', 'Definitely an original idea - does that thing take film?', '2004-03-31 22:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(646672, 66937, 10047, '<td valign="top">Creative and very good detail. I like how you removed the label from the can. I''m assuming so it wouldn''t be a distraction. Nice composition and colors.</td>', 'Creative and very good detail. I like how you removed the label from the can. I''m assuming so it wouldn''t be a distraction. Nice composition and colors.', '2004-03-31 22:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(646673, 67379, 18191, '<td valign="top">This would have been a 9 or a ten witht the exception of three things. First and most obvious to me---the yellow stain and awkward shadow in the middle left near the end of the cd''s. Secondly, i think that the diagonal of the CD''s should have been a diagonal of the rectangular frame. Lastly, it would have been more effective (even without the diagonals alligned) if the cd''s went all the way across.</td>', 'This would have been a 9 or a ten witht the exception of three things. First and most obvious to me---the yellow stain and awkward shadow in the middle left near the end of the cd''s. Secondly, i think that the diagonal of the CD''s should have been a diagonal of the rectangular frame. Lastly, it would have been more effective (even without the diagonals alligned) if the cd''s went all the way across.', '2004-03-31 22:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(646674, 67293, 18887, '<td valign="top">Who volunteered their pool table?!<br/> <br/>I like the composition and the blue felt/white eggs looks good.  Could have turned the 8-ball slightly to catch the 8, which is a little obscured.  Otherwise, good, um, shot!</td>', 'Who volunteered their pool table?! I like the composition and the blue felt/white eggs looks good.  Could have turned the 8-ball slightly to catch the 8, which is a little obscured.  Otherwise, good, um, shot!', '2004-03-31 22:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(646675, 66937, 18191, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of my favorites. Very funny! Great shot.</td>', 'Definitely one of my favorites. Very funny! Great shot.', '2004-03-31 22:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(646676, 67182, 17724, '<td valign="top">I am sure that I am not the only one to say it, but that hat is definitely not out of place - it should stay right where it is! :)</td>', 'I am sure that I am not the only one to say it, but that hat is definitely not out of place - it should stay right where it is! :)', '2004-03-31 22:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(646678, 67413, 18374, '<td valign="top">Heh heh heh.  I got a good chuckle out of this!</td>', 'Heh heh heh.  I got a good chuckle out of this!', '2004-03-31 22:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(646679, 66875, 18191, '<td valign="top">I had a very similar idea and i like the concept, except the composition does not work well for me and the reflection and shadows on the board are a bit distracting.</td>', 'I had a very similar idea and i like the concept, except the composition does not work well for me and the reflection and shadows on the board are a bit distracting.', '2004-03-31 22:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
