(646883, 66655, 9747, '<td valign="top">Is this for real? If so, great timing! Other than the background having noise, this is a very cool picture!</td>', 'Is this for real? If so, great timing! Other than the background having noise, this is a very cool picture!', '2004-04-01 00:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(646885, 67523, 18419, '<td valign="top">Well spotted.  The flat lighting helps add to the atmosphere.</td>', 'Well spotted.  The flat lighting helps add to the atmosphere.', '2004-04-01 00:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(646888, 67448, 9747, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, this is funny. Looks like a lot of work was put into this photograph! The first time I saw this, it made me take a double take and laugh. I only wish that the wall was a bit more whiter/cleaner (for impact) with the clock having a different colored frame. Maybe next time, for added effect, tape the zipper down and roll up the sleeves (the sleeve on the left is pointing upwards). ;-) The guy''s expression is great! I hope he didn''t get dizzy from all the blood rushing to his head.</td>', 'Hahaha, this is funny. Looks like a lot of work was put into this photograph! The first time I saw this, it made me take a double take and laugh. I only wish that the wall was a bit more whiter/cleaner (for impact) with the clock having a different colored frame. Maybe next time, for added effect, tape the zipper down and roll up the sleeves (the sleeve on the left is pointing upwards). ;-) The guy''s expression is great! I hope he didn''t get dizzy from all the blood rushing to his head.', '2004-04-01 00:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(646890, 66628, 18419, '<td valign="top">Very good DOF and lighting.</td>', 'Very good DOF and lighting.', '2004-04-01 00:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
