(646900, 66998, 9747, '<td valign="top">As a poker player, I can relate to this picture all too well! What bothers me is the background - would have been better if there had been poker-related items, such as coins or chips. In fact, without anything in the background (or even black background) probably would work just as well. Nice, clear image overall!</td>', 'As a poker player, I can relate to this picture all too well! What bothers me is the background - would have been better if there had been poker-related items, such as coins or chips. In fact, without anything in the background (or even black background) probably would work just as well. Nice, clear image overall!', '2004-04-01 00:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(646901, 67483, 18419, '<td valign="top">Excellent spot; the parliment tower splits the curch perfectly.</td>', 'Excellent spot; the parliment tower splits the curch perfectly.', '2004-04-01 00:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
