(646964, 67552, 6349, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would have benefited tremendously from better black and white conversion.  If you would allow me to take a look at the original photo after the challenge I''d be glad to mess around with it.  I find the shot very appealing except for the fact that it is very hard to differentiate between the umbrella and the background as there is not much contrast.  Also, I would have composed it to get rid of that branch in the upper right and get the umbrella out of dead center.  You have captured a great mood and scene that I believe can be improved upon without actually finding it again, which is always the best option.</td>', 'I think this shot would have benefited tremendously from better black and white conversion.  If you would allow me to take a look at the original photo after the challenge I''d be glad to mess around with it.  I find the shot very appealing except for the fact that it is very hard to differentiate between the umbrella and the background as there is not much contrast.  Also, I would have composed it to get rid of that branch in the upper right and get the umbrella out of dead center.  You have captured a great mood and scene that I believe can be improved upon without actually finding it again, which is always the best option.', '2004-04-01 00:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(646966, 67506, 16385, '<td valign="top">overexpose</td>', 'overexpose', '2004-04-01 00:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(646970, 67076, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo of a great statue but I don''t really think it''s out pf place.  Still going to add this to my favorites when this is over though.  :)</td>', 'This is a great photo of a great statue but I don''t really think it''s out pf place.  Still going to add this to my favorites when this is over though.  :)', '2004-04-01 00:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(646972, 67435, 18419, '<td valign="top">A beautiful set-up and idea.  It''s a shame about the snow; it gets confused with the petal and makes it look like the bottom half of the stem is under water. But as I said, excellent photo!</td>', 'A beautiful set-up and idea.  It''s a shame about the snow; it gets confused with the petal and makes it look like the bottom half of the stem is under water. But as I said, excellent photo!', '2004-04-01 01:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(646973, 67548, 16385, '<td valign="top">nice pic but maybe not for this challenge</td>', 'nice pic but maybe not for this challenge', '2004-04-01 01:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(646977, 67475, 6349, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  What''s up with all the toothpaste and toothbrush shots though?  All of a sudden that''s all there are.  There weren''t common a few weeks ago.  I guess it''s the new craze.  This photo, in my opinion, actually uses these rather boring subjects in a remarkable way.  I am very pleased with the focus on the mouse alone.  Keep up the great work.</td>', 'Very nice.  What''s up with all the toothpaste and toothbrush shots though?  All of a sudden that''s all there are.  There weren''t common a few weeks ago.  I guess it''s the new craze.  This photo, in my opinion, actually uses these rather boring subjects in a remarkable way.  I am very pleased with the focus on the mouse alone.  Keep up the great work.', '2004-04-01 01:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(646978, 67351, 18505, '<td valign="top">Excellent interpretation of challenge.  I gave you a 10.  I hope you win!!!</td>', 'Excellent interpretation of challenge.  I gave you a 10.  I hope you win!!!', '2004-04-01 01:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
