(648694, 66640, 14355, '<td valign="top">If this picture were in focus, AND, you used a CD that had more art work on the label so it stood out as a CD and didn''t look like a normal record lable on a vinyl record, AND you took the picture from an interesting angle, and the picture had some color or ''life'' to it ........ you would have probably won this challenge.  You had an awesome idea here - but you picture looks like a bad B&amp;W from the 1950''s.</td>', 'If this picture were in focus, AND, you used a CD that had more art work on the label so it stood out as a CD and didn''t look like a normal record lable on a vinyl record, AND you took the picture from an interesting angle, and the picture had some color or ''life'' to it ........ you would have probably won this challenge.  You had an awesome idea here - but you picture looks like a bad B&W from the 1950''s.', '2004-04-01 16:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(648695, 67561, 15810, '<td valign="top">Very good. A good photo and humour. Thank god there are a couple.</td>', 'Very good. A good photo and humour. Thank god there are a couple.', '2004-04-01 16:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(648699, 67224, 14355, '<td valign="top">It''s called ''contrails''.  What''s so out of place having them over Nashville??  They don''t allow modern aircraft in the skies there?????</td>', 'It''s called ''contrails''.  What''s so out of place having them over Nashville??  They don''t allow modern aircraft in the skies there?????', '2004-04-01 16:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(648703, 67021, 14355, '<td valign="top">Now, this is out of place!  THANK YOU for taking the time to think up something original and executing it well with a decent picture!</td>', 'Now, this is out of place!  THANK YOU for taking the time to think up something original and executing it well with a decent picture!', '2004-04-01 16:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(648709, 67001, 14355, '<td valign="top">Ducks, water, and brush are always in place.  I sure hope you are better with a shotgun than a camera.</td>', 'Ducks, water, and brush are always in place.  I sure hope you are better with a shotgun than a camera.', '2004-04-01 16:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
