(648765, 67093, 17505, '<td valign="top">Love the concept! Somehow it falls a little flat though. Perhaps sharper focus on the flames, or a smaller ice block, or several smaller ice blocks...I''m not sure how to ''fix'' it.</td>', 'Love the concept! Somehow it falls a little flat though. Perhaps sharper focus on the flames, or a smaller ice block, or several smaller ice blocks...I''m not sure how to ''fix'' it.', '2004-04-01 17:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
