(648773, 67423, 17505, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge, the truth isn''t always pretty. I would have cropped out a little more of the sky, but that''s minor.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge, the truth isn''t always pretty. I would have cropped out a little more of the sky, but that''s minor.', '2004-04-01 17:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
