(648917, 67093, 16982, '<td valign="top">Plus one mark for the good idea.  If I was going to criticise (I suppose that is what the comment box is for) then I would say that it looks a little overexposed and - no pun intended - lacking "warmth".  A shot taken from an angle more to the left or right might have made this more interesting.</td>', 'Plus one mark for the good idea.  If I was going to criticise (I suppose that is what the comment box is for) then I would say that it looks a little overexposed and - no pun intended - lacking "warmth".  A shot taken from an angle more to the left or right might have made this more interesting.', '2004-04-01 18:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(648918, 67388, 16965, '<td valign="top">I think he''s wearing a E-collar?  the flat white of the collar and the sharpness of the flash are distracting and very ''snap-shotish''  I''m not sure what is out of place here, sorry.</td>', 'I think he''s wearing a E-collar?  the flat white of the collar and the sharpness of the flash are distracting and very ''snap-shotish''  I''m not sure what is out of place here, sorry.', '2004-04-01 18:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
