(650117, 67019, 7687, '<td valign="top">Wow, way to think out of the box.  The boy certainly is "out of place", but I think this is a very strong shot.  The negative space on the left has just enough texture to hold its own against the visual weight of the boy on the right.  Great work!</td>', 'Wow, way to think out of the box.  The boy certainly is "out of place", but I think this is a very strong shot.  The negative space on the left has just enough texture to hold its own against the visual weight of the boy on the right.  Great work!', '2004-04-02 06:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(650118, 67589, 16126, '<td valign="top">This would have been a nice picture with better exposure, better focus, and without the uneven border.</td>', 'This would have been a nice picture with better exposure, better focus, and without the uneven border.', '2004-04-02 06:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(650119, 67475, 7687, '<td valign="top">Great use of Shallow DOF...wow!  This is my pick for a ribbon...great idea and wonderful execution.  I only have two things/questions I''d like to mention.  The exposure inside the cup seems a bit dark.  Also, I''m wondering if having a bit darker cup would help make the white/lightness of the mouse''s head and pink paws show up a bit more?<br/> <br/>Again, I think this just might be a winner.</td>', 'Great use of Shallow DOF...wow!  This is my pick for a ribbon...great idea and wonderful execution.  I only have two things/questions I''d like to mention.  The exposure inside the cup seems a bit dark.  Also, I''m wondering if having a bit darker cup would help make the white/lightness of the mouse''s head and pink paws show up a bit more? Again, I think this just might be a winner.', '2004-04-02 06:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(650120, 67362, 16126, '<td valign="top">sky and trees in the background are overexposed</td>', 'sky and trees in the background are overexposed', '2004-04-02 06:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
