(650846, 67504, 327, '<td valign="top">I voted on this several days ago, now as my usual I''m back to check my vote and to comment.<br/>I think--- why I didn''t comment on this shot earlier is that it made me feel uncomfortable. I really have to say I feel like I''m intruding on this woman.  She is not well, in a nursing home, hospital.....under some care anyway.<br/>I do see the wine on the commode.<br/>I don''t normally shy from illness etc..I am a retired nurse. All that being said, it just made me feel I should not be there. :) Sorry just my feeling. Now if that is what emotion you were trying to invoke...then you are a success!!</td>', 'I voted on this several days ago, now as my usual I''m back to check my vote and to comment.I think--- why I didn''t comment on this shot earlier is that it made me feel uncomfortable. I really have to say I feel like I''m intruding on this woman.  She is not well, in a nursing home, hospital.....under some care anyway.I do see the wine on the commode.I don''t normally shy from illness etc..I am a retired nurse. All that being said, it just made me feel I should not be there. :) Sorry just my feeling. Now if that is what emotion you were trying to invoke...then you are a success!!', '2004-04-02 18:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
