(650885, 67372, 16402, '<td valign="top">Sorry but a worm in an apple is gross and undesireable, but not out of place. Pretty natural place for a worm to be actually.</td>', 'Sorry but a worm in an apple is gross and undesireable, but not out of place. Pretty natural place for a worm to be actually.', '2004-04-02 18:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
