(650928, 67293, 3102, '<td valign="top">This one is the winner.  Plain and simple.  I will have to say that this is one of the weakest challenges overall that I have seen in quite some time, but it was refreshing to see a very creative photo like this come out of it.  You obviously put a lot of thought into the execution and lighting of this one.  The light reflecting on the foreground of the eggs is an excellent touch, and you carried out the motion very, very well -- especially considering that the pool player had to have been extremely still to pull off what I''m assuming was a long exposure.  This is one of the only ones I felt inspired to comment on... so I might as well go on and on, eh?  :)  Allow me to be the first to congratulate you on your ribbon -- I''m sure it''s on the way! - 10</td>', 'This one is the winner.  Plain and simple.  I will have to say that this is one of the weakest challenges overall that I have seen in quite some time, but it was refreshing to see a very creative photo like this come out of it.  You obviously put a lot of thought into the execution and lighting of this one.  The light reflecting on the foreground of the eggs is an excellent touch, and you carried out the motion very, very well -- especially considering that the pool player had to have been extremely still to pull off what I''m assuming was a long exposure.  This is one of the only ones I felt inspired to comment on... so I might as well go on and on, eh?  :)  Allow me to be the first to congratulate you on your ribbon -- I''m sure it''s on the way! - 10', '2004-04-02 19:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(650929, 67021, 3102, '<td valign="top">Whoa - disgusting, dude!  Nicely done -- the lighting and color is very impressive!  Still disgusting, though.  :)  - 9</td>', 'Whoa - disgusting, dude!  Nicely done -- the lighting and color is very impressive!  Still disgusting, though.  :)  - 9', '2004-04-02 19:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
