(651345, 67326, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good idea; good composition on cone; tough exposure overall though, and the white flowers are unfortunately, overexposed here.  Maybe a reflector or something reflective serving that role might have evened up the light a bit more to make proper exposure possible.</td>', 'Good idea; good composition on cone; tough exposure overall though, and the white flowers are unfortunately, overexposed here.  Maybe a reflector or something reflective serving that role might have evened up the light a bit more to make proper exposure possible.', '2004-04-03 01:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(651347, 67198, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the dogs.  I like the idea.  It works, but somehow the black dog, while out of place, could be more in the forefront rather than a bit hidden.  I know you can''t really pose them, but I would have loved to see the black dog right between the pose of the fron two dogs.</td>', 'Good capture of the dogs.  I like the idea.  It works, but somehow the black dog, while out of place, could be more in the forefront rather than a bit hidden.  I know you can''t really pose them, but I would have loved to see the black dog right between the pose of the fron two dogs.', '2004-04-03 01:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(651349, 67314, 12253, '<td valign="top">Wow, you are trusting that to be water proof!   A very good idea, and a pretty good capture.  It would have been nice to avoid the shadow of the fist, and to avoid the stone to the left.</td>', 'Wow, you are trusting that to be water proof!   A very good idea, and a pretty good capture.  It would have been nice to avoid the shadow of the fist, and to avoid the stone to the left.', '2004-04-03 01:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(651357, 66937, 16106, '<td valign="top">Ewww,Gross, disgusting, great! The reflection of the eye in the lid is what puts this in ribbon land. Good compostion,great lightings trong colors, and a nice sense of story. the 10. the only 10</td>', 'Ewww,Gross, disgusting, great! The reflection of the eye in the lid is what puts this in ribbon land. Good compostion,great lightings trong colors, and a nice sense of story. the 10. the only 10', '2004-04-03 01:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(651358, 66655, 16106, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. good subject, nice color, fine backround blur. And all of this outside? Don''t you have anywhere insine to shoot? If the focus was better this would be my top pick, as it is, one of the top 3 scoring a 9</td>', 'Very nice shot. good subject, nice color, fine backround blur. And all of this outside? Don''t you have anywhere insine to shoot? If the focus was better this would be my top pick, as it is, one of the top 3 scoring a 9', '2004-04-03 01:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(651362, 66940, 16106, '<td valign="top">That is funny, a bit fuzzy but water will do that. Good colors and the title brings it home. my daughter says his name is Patrick Star.</td>', 'That is funny, a bit fuzzy but water will do that. Good colors and the title brings it home. my daughter says his name is Patrick Star.', '2004-04-03 01:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(651365, 67507, 16106, '<td valign="top">The only "Isn''t my baby cute" shot in the competition and it actually is on challenge and a good shot! Amazing! Great expression you caught and funny without being endangering. Good close up work, the slight distortion helps the shot a lot. Now what I don''t like. The background rectangular shape (floor? table top?) is distracting, repeating the square shape of the composition but not exactly. The conversion to B&amp;W is a bit too soft, while the warm middle tones are sweet, I miss any bits of true black that would have made this shot pop. Good work, top ten.</td>', 'The only "Isn''t my baby cute" shot in the competition and it actually is on challenge and a good shot! Amazing! Great expression you caught and funny without being endangering. Good close up work, the slight distortion helps the shot a lot. Now what I don''t like. The background rectangular shape (floor? table top?) is distracting, repeating the square shape of the composition but not exactly. The conversion to B&W is a bit too soft, while the warm middle tones are sweet, I miss any bits of true black that would have made this shot pop. Good work, top ten.', '2004-04-03 01:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(651369, 67444, 16106, '<td valign="top">In the crowded catagory of one similar object of a different color (including my own) this one stands out as the best. Simple , well lit and the choice of blending the many white push-pins into a similar colored backround allows the exception to pop. It''s not easy to be so technically good to pull an oft repeated shot out of the pack, but you did. Although shouldn''t the buffalo soldier pin have been black and al the other pins been red? ;-)</td>', 'In the crowded catagory of one similar object of a different color (including my own) this one stands out as the best. Simple , well lit and the choice of blending the many white push-pins into a similar colored backround allows the exception to pop. It''s not easy to be so technically good to pull an oft repeated shot out of the pack, but you did. Although shouldn''t the buffalo soldier pin have been black and al the other pins been red? ;-)', '2004-04-03 01:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(651414, 67520, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful work of art. One of my two favorites in this challenge. I love the soft blue color scheme.<br/>My only suggestion would be to straighten out the horizon some.    still a 10</td>', 'This is a beautiful work of art. One of my two favorites in this challenge. I love the soft blue color scheme.My only suggestion would be to straighten out the horizon some.    still a 10', '2004-04-03 03:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(651418, 67475, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of the challenge. Nice work in every way. The shallow depth puts all the emphasis on the subject. (is his name Algernon ? well, give him a flower just the same)   Beautiful and creative work!   10</td>', 'This is my favorite of the challenge. Nice work in every way. The shallow depth puts all the emphasis on the subject. (is his name Algernon ? well, give him a flower just the same)   Beautiful and creative work!   10', '2004-04-03 03:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
