(651525, 67317, 15982, '<td valign="top">Where''s the other king? The picture could have been straightened more and could have used a sharper focus - use a larger F-stop value (smaller aperture setting) in conjunction with a faster shutter speed to keep the exposure right. The composition could be a little better too. But the exposure is nice and a good idea. Good luck!</td>', 'Where''s the other king? The picture could have been straightened more and could have used a sharper focus - use a larger F-stop value (smaller aperture setting) in conjunction with a faster shutter speed to keep the exposure right. The composition could be a little better too. But the exposure is nice and a good idea. Good luck!', '2004-04-03 09:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(651531, 67494, 18361, '<td valign="top">cool idea</td>', 'cool idea', '2004-04-03 09:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(651533, 67570, 15982, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big stickler about the the rules of photography, but I think the rule of thirds would have made this composition more powerfule. Nice light and color though.</td>', 'I''m not a big stickler about the the rules of photography, but I think the rule of thirds would have made this composition more powerfule. Nice light and color though.', '2004-04-03 09:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
