(652452, 66769, 12253, '<td valign="top">Funny!  A good idea.  You might consider using levels after the challenge to add some more contrast as it appears a bit washed out.  Also, whereas the water''s distortion adds a bit of an interesting cartoon  look here, I think the shot will be improved when you can post process it to reduce the distortion.  In any case: Clever!</td>', 'Funny!  A good idea.  You might consider using levels after the challenge to add some more contrast as it appears a bit washed out.  Also, whereas the water''s distortion adds a bit of an interesting cartoon  look here, I think the shot will be improved when you can post process it to reduce the distortion.  In any case: Clever!', '2004-04-04 00:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
