(652726, 66940, 17505, '<td valign="top">Cute, but entirely natural and quite out of focus. Perhaps using manual focus would help out with that if you have is available on your camera. Better luck with your next entry. =-)</td>', 'Cute, but entirely natural and quite out of focus. Perhaps using manual focus would help out with that if you have is available on your camera. Better luck with your next entry. =-)', '2004-04-04 10:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(652740, 67456, 17505, '<td valign="top">To better your scores you''ll need to enter photographs that have a sharper focus. Use a tripod or stabilize the camera by holding it agains the side ot a tree when you''re outdoors.  Also, there is a lot of glare from the sun. Take photographs with the sun behind you to avoid this. THen you''ll have to work to avoid getting your shadow in teh picture.</td>', 'To better your scores you''ll need to enter photographs that have a sharper focus. Use a tripod or stabilize the camera by holding it agains the side ot a tree when you''re outdoors.  Also, there is a lot of glare from the sun. Take photographs with the sun behind you to avoid this. THen you''ll have to work to avoid getting your shadow in teh picture.', '2004-04-04 11:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(652750, 67417, 17505, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I''m really torn about my feelings towards this photo. It feels a little too dark and I don''t like the blur but I like the curves and the placement of the man. I don''t expect this photo will do well, but...maybe...Hmm, well...good luck!</td>', 'Interesting shot. I''m really torn about my feelings towards this photo. It feels a little too dark and I don''t like the blur but I like the curves and the placement of the man. I don''t expect this photo will do well, but...maybe...Hmm, well...good luck!', '2004-04-04 11:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
