(653334, 67455, 18846, '<td valign="top">I am not sure if the title is really appropriate...<br/>It''s a clear shot, but... I can''t exactly say that I like the composition, nevertheless it is kind of motivated by the situation... you cannot make a very well balanced composition when treating a subject like this... i still would have tried a different approach on the subject....<br/>anyway, nice job!</td>', 'I am not sure if the title is really appropriate...It''s a clear shot, but... I can''t exactly say that I like the composition, nevertheless it is kind of motivated by the situation... you cannot make a very well balanced composition when treating a subject like this... i still would have tried a different approach on the subject....anyway, nice job!', '2004-04-04 21:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(653343, 67381, 18846, '<td valign="top">too much empty space in the lower part of the shot... way too much!<br/>and what''s the title and the subject got to do with "out of place"?<br/>also not enough light...</td>', 'too much empty space in the lower part of the shot... way too much!and what''s the title and the subject got to do with "out of place"?also not enough light...', '2004-04-04 21:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
