(654053, 67379, 15919, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and a good setup.  Maybe you should have given it a more croping or somehow let the CD-stack through the whole frame.  Did you try another angel, f. instance from a lower angel  and use shallower DOF, keeping the vinyl and closebye CD´s in focus but blurring out other CD´s.  Just an idea.  Fine image.</td>', 'Nice idea and a good setup.  Maybe you should have given it a more croping or somehow let the CD-stack through the whole frame.  Did you try another angel, f. instance from a lower angel  and use shallower DOF, keeping the vinyl and closebye CD´s in focus but blurring out other CD´s.  Just an idea.  Fine image.', '2004-04-05 08:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
