(654642, 67479, 19342, '<td valign="top">I''m going to pick nits and say that the sign isn''t straight, however, I like the subject.  Good job.</td>', 'I''m going to pick nits and say that the sign isn''t straight, however, I like the subject.  Good job.', '2004-04-05 17:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
