(654647, 67021, 19342, '<td valign="top">For someone who puts catsup on her catsup, even I wouldn''t put it on Cheerios!  Nice shot.</td>', 'For someone who puts catsup on her catsup, even I wouldn''t put it on Cheerios!  Nice shot.', '2004-04-05 17:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
