(655196, 66633, 18722, '<td valign="top">With most of the out of place entries, the subject that is out of place needs to be the center of attention, but this I think is good enough it would have been made better by placing the out of place item out of center.  It draws the eye to itself, no need to force it.</td>', 'With most of the out of place entries, the subject that is out of place needs to be the center of attention, but this I think is good enough it would have been made better by placing the out of place item out of center.  It draws the eye to itself, no need to force it.', '2004-04-06 07:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
