(655210, 66937, 5792, '<td valign="top">Kool man that someone takes the challenge seriously. I "see" here that you took on the challenge head on, eyeball to eyeball so to speak. You must be a pupil of great photography and your iris was stopped down just right for this little peach of a shot. Just one thing, did you use mirrors or somethin'' to make it look like your eye was in the can? I can tell it must have took a long time cause it is bloodshot. Should get a good score cause of that.<br/> <br/>Top notch composition, lighting and interest. Capturing the reflection in the lid is a great touch. It is simply the "best" photograph in the challenge.</td>', 'Kool man that someone takes the challenge seriously. I "see" here that you took on the challenge head on, eyeball to eyeball so to speak. You must be a pupil of great photography and your iris was stopped down just right for this little peach of a shot. Just one thing, did you use mirrors or somethin'' to make it look like your eye was in the can? I can tell it must have took a long time cause it is bloodshot. Should get a good score cause of that. Top notch composition, lighting and interest. Capturing the reflection in the lid is a great touch. It is simply the "best" photograph in the challenge.', '2004-04-06 08:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(655214, 67293, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very creative and well done. Should be a ribbon contender. Did you make the eight on the "break"? :)</td>', 'Very creative and well done. Should be a ribbon contender. Did you make the eight on the "break"? :)', '2004-04-06 08:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(655275, 66998, 14255, '<td valign="top">Nice Idea. Shame about the Salt Shaker &amp; Pack of Fags in the background. Hand &amp; Cards on their own would have made a much better shot</td>', 'Nice Idea. Shame about the Salt Shaker & Pack of Fags in the background. Hand & Cards on their own would have made a much better shot', '2004-04-06 09:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(655286, 67450, 4817, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot!!<br/> <br/>What really makes this work for me is not the buildings themselves, but the tiny people at the bottom. They add a great sense of perspective to the pic, and give you an idea of how big the buildings really are. 9/10</td>', 'Lovely shot!! What really makes this work for me is not the buildings themselves, but the tiny people at the bottom. They add a great sense of perspective to the pic, and give you an idea of how big the buildings really are. 9/10', '2004-04-06 10:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(655301, 67201, 5391, '<td valign="top">Technically very good shot that actually "speaks" without needing a title.  I might have tried it in portrait format to capture a bit more shadow and eliminate the extra white space at the edges.  The lower right corner also has a dark spot that''s a bit distracting.  But the lighting works really well and you''ve set it up really nicely.</td>', 'Technically very good shot that actually "speaks" without needing a title.  I might have tried it in portrait format to capture a bit more shadow and eliminate the extra white space at the edges.  The lower right corner also has a dark spot that''s a bit distracting.  But the lighting works really well and you''ve set it up really nicely.', '2004-04-06 10:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
