(655536, 67033, 16965, '<td valign="top">being two inches off the ground isn''t exactly out of place for a human...  40 feet off the ground, now that would definately be out of place....</td>', 'being two inches off the ground isn''t exactly out of place for a human...  40 feet off the ground, now that would definately be out of place....', '2004-04-06 13:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
