(655567, 67563, 17296, '<td valign="top">Nice coloration to this photo, although the composition looks slightly tilted towards the down right corner... Very nice though.</td>', 'Nice coloration to this photo, although the composition looks slightly tilted towards the down right corner... Very nice though.', '2004-04-06 14:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(655569, 67499, 17296, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. I''m not sure I would have put them smack dab in the center. But I think it works. They do look out of place. 9</td>', 'I like this photo. I''m not sure I would have put them smack dab in the center. But I think it works. They do look out of place. 9', '2004-04-06 14:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(655571, 67293, 17296, '<td valign="top">Cool photo. Strangely, the 8 ball is what looks out of place, go figure. I don''t like the little red chalk on the table and the guideline for the rack on the felt (but I suppose there wasn''t much you could do about that (maybe use the other end of the table?) The extra orange light on the eggs would work better if it was on all the eggs instead of just a few. <br/>I hope those eggs were hard-boiled or you had a mess on your hands after this shot!</td>', 'Cool photo. Strangely, the 8 ball is what looks out of place, go figure. I don''t like the little red chalk on the table and the guideline for the rack on the felt (but I suppose there wasn''t much you could do about that (maybe use the other end of the table?) The extra orange light on the eggs would work better if it was on all the eggs instead of just a few. I hope those eggs were hard-boiled or you had a mess on your hands after this shot!', '2004-04-06 14:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(655572, 67201, 17296, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Seems as though the focus is a little soft, but I like it.</td>', 'Nice composition. Seems as though the focus is a little soft, but I like it.', '2004-04-06 14:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(655573, 66652, 17296, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. One of my favorites in the challenge. Very simple.</td>', 'I like this very much. One of my favorites in the challenge. Very simple.', '2004-04-06 14:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(655575, 67435, 7889, '<td valign="top">Very striking photo and my fav of the challenge, well done</td>', 'Very striking photo and my fav of the challenge, well done', '2004-04-06 14:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(655577, 67478, 17296, '<td valign="top">This is so weird, I don''t even know what to say. Your model must be a really good friend to do this for you... <br/>Not real fond of the yellow border.</td>', 'This is so weird, I don''t even know what to say. Your model must be a really good friend to do this for you... Not real fond of the yellow border.', '2004-04-06 14:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(655578, 67195, 17296, '<td valign="top">Very cool. If only you could get rid of the little crumbs and spruce up the lighting a bit.</td>', 'Very cool. If only you could get rid of the little crumbs and spruce up the lighting a bit.', '2004-04-06 14:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(655579, 67407, 7889, '<td valign="top">certainly fits the challenge! I like the way you have concentrated on just this part of the elephant.</td>', 'certainly fits the challenge! I like the way you have concentrated on just this part of the elephant.', '2004-04-06 14:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(655581, 67198, 17296, '<td valign="top">The focus is so crisp in this photo. I''m not fond of the "stuff" in the background or the drain in the foreground. And I wish I could see more of the black dog. They all look really soft and friendly. :)</td>', 'The focus is so crisp in this photo. I''m not fond of the "stuff" in the background or the drain in the foreground. And I wish I could see more of the black dog. They all look really soft and friendly. :)', '2004-04-06 14:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(655582, 67173, 7889, '<td valign="top">Good capture and I like the use of b&amp;w, contrast is good</td>', 'Good capture and I like the use of b&w, contrast is good', '2004-04-06 14:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(655583, 67570, 17296, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Nice colors.</td>', 'Great composition. Nice colors.', '2004-04-06 14:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(655584, 67194, 7889, '<td valign="top">Good colour, good focus and an interesting subject.</td>', 'Good colour, good focus and an interesting subject.', '2004-04-06 14:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(655585, 67588, 17296, '<td valign="top">Great shot. This has to place top ten...</td>', 'Great shot. This has to place top ten...', '2004-04-06 14:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(655589, 67230, 17296, '<td valign="top">This is a great motion capture of this duck (a little soft maybe). I wish we could see some more of the pool and that the horizontal line of the pool (if it is a pool, I guess) was not crooked.</td>', 'This is a great motion capture of this duck (a little soft maybe). I wish we could see some more of the pool and that the horizontal line of the pool (if it is a pool, I guess) was not crooked.', '2004-04-06 14:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(655591, 67195, 7889, '<td valign="top">Simple but very effective, some of the backround ''bits'' (crumbs?) tend to detract from the image but overall I like this.</td>', 'Simple but very effective, some of the backround ''bits'' (crumbs?) tend to detract from the image but overall I like this.', '2004-04-06 14:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(655592, 67428, 17296, '<td valign="top">Love to know how this was done. A little noise in the blue. Nice composition.</td>', 'Love to know how this was done. A little noise in the blue. Nice composition.', '2004-04-06 14:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(655596, 66691, 7889, '<td valign="top">Cant really make much out of this no matter how long I have looked at it</td>', 'Cant really make much out of this no matter how long I have looked at it', '2004-04-06 14:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(655597, 67200, 11738, '<td valign="top">This would have made for an even cooler shot if it only contained the staircase.</td>', 'This would have made for an even cooler shot if it only contained the staircase.', '2004-04-06 14:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(655598, 67127, 17296, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I love the lighting, looks like sunset to me. I kinda wish the pink flower was on the sunny side, but that''s nit-picking. Looks like the white flowers in the sun are ever-so-slightly overexposed.</td>', 'Very nice. I love the lighting, looks like sunset to me. I kinda wish the pink flower was on the sunny side, but that''s nit-picking. Looks like the white flowers in the sun are ever-so-slightly overexposed.', '2004-04-06 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(655600, 66655, 17296, '<td valign="top">A little grainy. Very nice though.</td>', 'A little grainy. Very nice though.', '2004-04-06 14:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(655601, 67387, 11738, '<td valign="top">What''s out of palce here, the fog?  Fog is part of many landscapes.  Nice vista, but hardly fits the challenge.</td>', 'What''s out of palce here, the fog?  Fog is part of many landscapes.  Nice vista, but hardly fits the challenge.', '2004-04-06 14:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(655602, 67479, 17296, '<td valign="top">This is probably less out of place than we think... Good shot.</td>', 'This is probably less out of place than we think... Good shot.', '2004-04-06 14:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(655603, 67519, 7889, '<td valign="top">Its humour but not my type, technically its ok, colour and focus is good, I would have cropped it to cut out the buttons etc. Dont think you will be too popular with this one!</td>', 'Its humour but not my type, technically its ok, colour and focus is good, I would have cropped it to cut out the buttons etc. Dont think you will be too popular with this one!', '2004-04-06 14:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(655605, 67425, 11738, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the blown out edge on the right, but cool shot nonetheless.  These types of shots are hard to pull off without having lots of distractions like the ones present here.  Original idea.</td>', 'Too bad about the blown out edge on the right, but cool shot nonetheless.  These types of shots are hard to pull off without having lots of distractions like the ones present here.  Original idea.', '2004-04-06 14:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(655606, 66498, 7889, '<td valign="top">Flash/Lighting is too harsh and the background is a bit distracting</td>', 'Flash/Lighting is too harsh and the background is a bit distracting', '2004-04-06 14:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(655607, 66973, 11738, '<td valign="top">Funny, but focus is too soft.</td>', 'Funny, but focus is too soft.', '2004-04-06 14:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(655609, 66788, 17296, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and contrast in this (maybe a little dark) but it seems a bit too staged for me and you had to spell it out in the title. But it''s a great looking photo, so I don''t know what I''m complaining about.</td>', 'I like the lighting and contrast in this (maybe a little dark) but it seems a bit too staged for me and you had to spell it out in the title. But it''s a great looking photo, so I don''t know what I''m complaining about.', '2004-04-06 14:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(655610, 66788, 7889, '<td valign="top">Technically a good shot, contrast is good and foucs is sharp.</td>', 'Technically a good shot, contrast is good and foucs is sharp.', '2004-04-06 14:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(655613, 67384, 17296, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the rainbow, but since it''s not really a defined object and rather blurry by nature, the photo feels like it lacks focus. Maybe something in the foreground would have helped this.</td>', 'Good capture of the rainbow, but since it''s not really a defined object and rather blurry by nature, the photo feels like it lacks focus. Maybe something in the foreground would have helped this.', '2004-04-06 14:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(655614, 67524, 7889, '<td valign="top">The idea is good but the lighting/flash is to harsh for me</td>', 'The idea is good but the lighting/flash is to harsh for me', '2004-04-06 14:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(655616, 66463, 17296, '<td valign="top">Great photo. This would qualify as a "Wheels" entry too... very interesting composition.</td>', 'Great photo. This would qualify as a "Wheels" entry too... very interesting composition.', '2004-04-06 14:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(655617, 67046, 17296, '<td valign="top">I need that button.</td>', 'I need that button.', '2004-04-06 14:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(655618, 66514, 5364, '<td valign="top">The scarf was a nice touch.</td>', 'The scarf was a nice touch.', '2004-04-06 14:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(655620, 67518, 17296, '<td valign="top">Nice sunlight. Would have liked if the sun wasn''t peeking through in the center, perhaps off to one side more. Focus is a little soft.</td>', 'Nice sunlight. Would have liked if the sun wasn''t peeking through in the center, perhaps off to one side more. Focus is a little soft.', '2004-04-06 14:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(655621, 67435, 17296, '<td valign="top">...you put that flower there... admit it!</td>', '...you put that flower there... admit it!', '2004-04-06 14:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(655628, 67490, 17296, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. That fork really looks like it should be saying "where am I?" I actually feel bad for this fork. You have conveyed a feeling to me with 3 toothbrushes and a fork. You are either an excellent photographer or I am emotionally retarded. <br/>Great job.</td>', 'I love this photo. That fork really looks like it should be saying "where am I?" I actually feel bad for this fork. You have conveyed a feeling to me with 3 toothbrushes and a fork. You are either an excellent photographer or I am emotionally retarded. Great job.', '2004-04-06 14:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(655632, 67078, 11738, '<td valign="top">ROFL!  Too bad the flash lighting is so harsh!  He really looks like he''s thinking: "Hmmm... where could I put that three of diamonds?".  Good work.</td>', 'ROFL!  Too bad the flash lighting is so harsh!  He really looks like he''s thinking: "Hmmm... where could I put that three of diamonds?".  Good work.', '2004-04-06 14:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(655634, 67487, 11738, '<td valign="top">Lot of noise in that sky.</td>', 'Lot of noise in that sky.', '2004-04-06 14:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(655641, 67479, 11738, '<td valign="top">GREAT IDEA!  One of my very few 10''s.  That glove on the left part of the image is slightly overexposed.</td>', 'GREAT IDEA!  One of my very few 10''s.  That glove on the left part of the image is slightly overexposed.', '2004-04-06 14:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(655643, 67427, 11738, '<td valign="top">So THAT''s why I''ve been seeing so many banana peels around the Volkswagen dealership.!  Good idea and not a bad shot.</td>', 'So THAT''s why I''ve been seeing so many banana peels around the Volkswagen dealership.!  Good idea and not a bad shot.', '2004-04-06 14:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(655646, 66533, 11738, '<td valign="top">Try to produce bigger images so that we can better see them.  You are allowed submitted pictures as big as 640 x 480 pixels.</td>', 'Try to produce bigger images so that we can better see them.  You are allowed submitted pictures as big as 640 x 480 pixels.', '2004-04-06 14:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(655648, 67533, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice product shot, but I so don''t get what your trying to convey here?  Is the bottle in front lady''s perfume while the other four are men''s products?</td>', 'Nice product shot, but I so don''t get what your trying to convey here?  Is the bottle in front lady''s perfume while the other four are men''s products?', '2004-04-06 14:45:38.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(655649, 67222, 11738, '<td valign="top">A closer or more zoomed in shot would have given this oomph.</td>', 'A closer or more zoomed in shot would have given this oomph.', '2004-04-06 14:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(655652, 67173, 5364, '<td valign="top">Great picture but you spoiled it a bit with the border</td>', 'Great picture but you spoiled it a bit with the border', '2004-04-06 14:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(655704, 66818, 18130, '<td valign="top">this reminds me of a joke...<br/>a screwdriver walks into a bar. the bartender looks at him and says "hey, screwdriver, we have a drink named after you"  then the screwdriver gets a confused look and says "you have a drink named steve?"</td>', 'this reminds me of a joke...a screwdriver walks into a bar. the bartender looks at him and says "hey, screwdriver, we have a drink named after you"  then the screwdriver gets a confused look and says "you have a drink named steve?"', '2004-04-06 16:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(655744, 66912, 17505, '<td valign="top">This would have been better if their had been a bowl or something holding it all together. My eye is drawn away from the center because the outside edge is so jagged. Good enough idea though.</td>', 'This would have been better if their had been a bowl or something holding it all together. My eye is drawn away from the center because the outside edge is so jagged. Good enough idea though.', '2004-04-06 17:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(655746, 67275, 17505, '<td valign="top">Cute. The halo around the objects adds to the picture. I would have chosen a color other than white.</td>', 'Cute. The halo around the objects adds to the picture. I would have chosen a color other than white.', '2004-04-06 17:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(655747, 67369, 5364, '<td valign="top">Your picture is rather overwhelmed by the bright area on the left</td>', 'Your picture is rather overwhelmed by the bright area on the left', '2004-04-06 17:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(655748, 67500, 5364, '<td valign="top">This has the potential to be a thought-provoking image, but the trains distract from the wreath too much.</td>', 'This has the potential to be a thought-provoking image, but the trains distract from the wreath too much.', '2004-04-06 17:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(655755, 67506, 5364, '<td valign="top">A nice idea, especially as there are two jackets. It''s a pity that with the dark background the jackets disappear. You might have been better taking the photo from the other side, so that the tablecloth provided a contrast.</td>', 'A nice idea, especially as there are two jackets. It''s a pity that with the dark background the jackets disappear. You might have been better taking the photo from the other side, so that the tablecloth provided a contrast.', '2004-04-06 17:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(655760, 67442, 5364, '<td valign="top">The idea is a good one, but you really needed to have the unwrapped object sharp. It looks to me like motion blur rather than being out of focus - was the camera hand-held or supported on something solid? Feel free to contact me if you think I am talking rubbish.</td>', 'The idea is a good one, but you really needed to have the unwrapped object sharp. It looks to me like motion blur rather than being out of focus - was the camera hand-held or supported on something solid? Feel free to contact me if you think I am talking rubbish.', '2004-04-06 17:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(655763, 67362, 5364, '<td valign="top">It''s a nnice interpretation of the challenge, but the snow is just a featureless white blob. I think you needed to get the exposure a bit darker to get some detail into the snow.</td>', 'It''s a nnice interpretation of the challenge, but the snow is just a featureless white blob. I think you needed to get the exposure a bit darker to get some detail into the snow.', '2004-04-06 17:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(655806, 67588, 10785, '<td valign="top">Hey! You stole my shot...<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=52196" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/168/thumb/52196.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/168/thumb/52196.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/168/thumb/52196.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>which I stole from darix<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=46877" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/157/thumb/46877.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/157/thumb/46877.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/157/thumb/46877.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-04-07 09:05:04.</i></td>', 'Hey! You stole my shot...   which I stole from darix ', '2004-04-06 17:43:20.000000', '2004-04-07 10:05:04.000000', 1),
(655858, 67444, 18191, '<td valign="top">oy yoy yoy!</td>', 'oy yoy yoy!', '2004-04-06 18:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(655882, 67482, 16775, '<td valign="top">as with alot of oddities i would probably suggest exaggerating your point of view.  go up close and shoot upward or maybe get up in a tree...the location of the viewers eye i think hurt what could be a very dramatic subject.  on the topic though i will give it a 7</td>', 'as with alot of oddities i would probably suggest exaggerating your point of view.  go up close and shoot upward or maybe get up in a tree...the location of the viewers eye i think hurt what could be a very dramatic subject.  on the topic though i will give it a 7', '2004-04-06 18:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(655883, 67358, 16775, '<td valign="top">i like this image.  i wonder if there is any other position that may have captured it better, but i can''t think of one.  it seems a little flat - perhaps some sharpening would strengthen the contrast.</td>', 'i like this image.  i wonder if there is any other position that may have captured it better, but i can''t think of one.  it seems a little flat - perhaps some sharpening would strengthen the contrast.', '2004-04-06 18:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(655887, 67401, 16775, '<td valign="top">onimages such as this i like to see the text flush or square with the edge of the photo.   shooting straight on i think makes a more bold statement when it comes to "propaganda-ish"  imagery like this.  as far as being "out of place", it seems that the store was trying to create this juxtaposition.  and in that respect, i lose some interest in the shot.  its a bit too obvious.</td>', 'onimages such as this i like to see the text flush or square with the edge of the photo.   shooting straight on i think makes a more bold statement when it comes to "propaganda-ish"  imagery like this.  as far as being "out of place", it seems that the store was trying to create this juxtaposition.  and in that respect, i lose some interest in the shot.  its a bit too obvious.', '2004-04-06 18:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(655888, 67254, 18484, '<td valign="top">great colour</td>', 'great colour', '2004-04-06 18:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
