(656956, 67479, 5391, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the kind comments - I was really excited about this shot and hoping it would do better than it did, but I had lots of comments from people who didn''t seem to understand what a mug shot is.  A cultural thing, I guess.  Ah, well...  I''m quite happy with it, myself.</td>', 'Thanks for all the kind comments - I was really excited about this shot and hoping it would do better than it did, but I had lots of comments from people who didn''t seem to understand what a mug shot is.  A cultural thing, I guess.  Ah, well...  I''m quite happy with it, myself.', '2004-04-07 10:26:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(656967, 67507, 17296, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Tiberius:</b></div><hr/><i> Excellent picture. I love her expression! <br/><i>Ran levels and Neat Image, resized and ran unsharp mask. Then I took the baby out of the box. And no, she didn''t eat any of the peanuts...</i> <br/>Hope you worked fast and your PC is fast as well and did not let the baby to wait too long in the box LOL<br/>Congrats on your ribbon! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah, I guess I took her out of the box first...</td>', 'Originally posted by Tiberius: Excellent picture. I love her expression! Ran levels and Neat Image, resized and ran unsharp mask. Then I took the baby out of the box. And no, she didn''t eat any of the peanuts... Hope you worked fast and your PC is fast as well and did not let the baby to wait too long in the box LOLCongrats on your ribbon!   Yeah, I guess I took her out of the box first...', '2004-04-07 10:36:21.000000', NULL, 0),
