(657083, 67078, 18098, '<td valign="top">My dog Clovis is having fun with a toy I placed behind the monitor. He often stands on the desk snooping around. The monitor was easy to photograph because it stayed still, Clovis was something else.  He would only stand still for a few seconds then jump all over the place.  I held a piece of paper over the flash to keep down the glare and wish that I had cropped off the very top of the photo. <br/> <br/>Thanks for all your comments and suggestions, I appreciate all of them very much!</td>', 'My dog Clovis is having fun with a toy I placed behind the monitor. He often stands on the desk snooping around. The monitor was easy to photograph because it stayed still, Clovis was something else.  He would only stand still for a few seconds then jump all over the place.  I held a piece of paper over the flash to keep down the glare and wish that I had cropped off the very top of the photo.  Thanks for all your comments and suggestions, I appreciate all of them very much!', '2004-04-07 11:30:34.000000', NULL, 0),
