(657994, 67496, 16965, '<td valign="top">This shot must have been difficult to obtain, and although it is a great shot, it was difficult for me to fit into this challenge becuase the snow doesn''t look like snow.  It looks like poorly white-balanced or desaturated sand, especially with the other twigs and bits.  Now that I know it is snow, it looks more like snow. <br/> <br/>Take note that during the challenge voting period, the voting public cannot see your "Photographer''s Comments" at all.  If I was able to see them I would have voted differently.<br/> <br/>As it stands, the snow didn''t look obviously like snow to me, and for me, was a difficult fit for this challenge.</td>', 'This shot must have been difficult to obtain, and although it is a great shot, it was difficult for me to fit into this challenge becuase the snow doesn''t look like snow.  It looks like poorly white-balanced or desaturated sand, especially with the other twigs and bits.  Now that I know it is snow, it looks more like snow.  Take note that during the challenge voting period, the voting public cannot see your "Photographer''s Comments" at all.  If I was able to see them I would have voted differently. As it stands, the snow didn''t look obviously like snow to me, and for me, was a difficult fit for this challenge.', '2004-04-07 16:59:50.000000', NULL, 0),
