(658029, 67224, 16965, '<td valign="top">...to expand why this is out place:  It is common for military operations to fly at EXTREMELY high altitudes, with multiple jets, and in a perfect grid pattern when doing surveillance of an area.  Mostly, you''d see these types of Contrails before some kind of military operation, or when some similar type of intelligence needs to be gathered.  The fact that we see perfectly aligned, and gridded Contrails over Nashville is totally out of place, and totally questionable!<br/> <br/>It looks close to dusk or dawn in the image, so I''m assuming that whatever party is doing it expected them to be obscured by nightfall.</td>', '...to expand why this is out place:  It is common for military operations to fly at EXTREMELY high altitudes, with multiple jets, and in a perfect grid pattern when doing surveillance of an area.  Mostly, you''d see these types of Contrails before some kind of military operation, or when some similar type of intelligence needs to be gathered.  The fact that we see perfectly aligned, and gridded Contrails over Nashville is totally out of place, and totally questionable! It looks close to dusk or dawn in the image, so I''m assuming that whatever party is doing it expected them to be obscured by nightfall.', '2004-04-07 17:20:28.000000', NULL, 0),
