(658256, 66769, 16093, '<td valign="top">One of the best photographs I''ve seen on this website. Some might say clever, but I think it goes beyond clever to achieve an imaginative and subtle quality, as well as a haunting momentary effect. The photographer has wonderful vision and emotion-what a change from most of the photographs I see on this site: content before style, expression before sensationalism.</td>', 'One of the best photographs I''ve seen on this website. Some might say clever, but I think it goes beyond clever to achieve an imaginative and subtle quality, as well as a haunting momentary effect. The photographer has wonderful vision and emotion-what a change from most of the photographs I see on this site: content before style, expression before sensationalism.', '2004-04-07 19:56:14.000000', NULL, 0),
