(692747, 67552, 7743, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea for a black and white image, however, good black and white images have lots of contrast.  The umbrella seems to blend into the rest of the image rather than stand out.  Also,  all the grass in the background is a little distracting.<br/> <br/>Ripples in the water may have added some interest.</td>', 'This is a nice idea for a black and white image, however, good black and white images have lots of contrast.  The umbrella seems to blend into the rest of the image rather than stand out.  Also,  all the grass in the background is a little distracting. Ripples in the water may have added some interest.', '2004-05-01 14:33:19.000000', NULL, 0),
