(701657, 67164, 9441, '<td valign="top">very nice photo...makes me feel like I could almost just reach out and touch them...the color is wonderful, and the clarity of it makes it almost 3-D....good job!</td>', 'very nice photo...makes me feel like I could almost just reach out and touch them...the color is wonderful, and the clarity of it makes it almost 3-D....good job!', '2004-05-06 11:41:42.000000', NULL, 0),
