(780142, 66919, 14773, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Glacierwolf:</b></div><hr/><i> You must be a city person??   I have no idea why you think this is out of place. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I think Gallatin was getting at the fact the silos look like sky scrapers on a prairie landscape...sort of out of place.</td>', 'Originally posted by Glacierwolf: You must be a city person??   I have no idea why you think this is out of place.   I think Gallatin was getting at the fact the silos look like sky scrapers on a prairie landscape...sort of out of place.', '2004-06-26 00:47:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(788332, 67455, 7350, '<td valign="top">This is not only a nice shot, it''s hilarious!  Although some might argue that, if he''s in the dog house, it may not exactly be out of place (I''ve been there a time or two myself), it definitely leaves me wondering.  What did he do to end up there?  Will he go back inside and apologize?  Where is the dog?  :)  Nice shot, good contrast.</td>', 'This is not only a nice shot, it''s hilarious!  Although some might argue that, if he''s in the dog house, it may not exactly be out of place (I''ve been there a time or two myself), it definitely leaves me wondering.  What did he do to end up there?  Will he go back inside and apologize?  Where is the dog?  :)  Nice shot, good contrast.', '2004-06-30 23:03:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(797942, 67131, 17794, '<td valign="top">Ouch!  Hope it wasn''t your yard! I love the colors and bright focus of this one.  I do agree with the "little more crop at the bottom" idea, but also agree it''s "not that big of a deal".</td>', 'Ouch!  Hope it wasn''t your yard! I love the colors and bright focus of this one.  I do agree with the "little more crop at the bottom" idea, but also agree it''s "not that big of a deal".', '2004-07-06 15:07:35.000000', NULL, 0),
