(1522828, 67198, 39221, '<td valign="top">heheh the black one knows he''s the odd one out :-) I think this shot would have worked really well from the front too, although you woulda had to lay in front of all those slobbering jaws - imagine the image face on, white/black/white/white - coulda been a ribbon ;-)</td>', 'heheh the black one knows he''s the odd one out :-) I think this shot would have worked really well from the front too, although you woulda had to lay in front of all those slobbering jaws - imagine the image face on, white/black/white/white - coulda been a ribbon ;-)', '2005-07-10 06:16:11.000000', NULL, 0),
